    "details": "Redmine reports:\n\n> - High: ReDoS in wiki macro argument parsing (#44657). Affects 6.0.0\n>   and later; fixed in 7.0.3, 6.1.6 and 6.0.12.\n> - High: OAuth token scope is ignored in Project.allowed_to_condition\n>   (#44625). Affects 6.1.0 and later; fixed in 7.0.3 and 6.1.6.\n> - High: Private project names and role assignments leaked via GET\n>   /groups/\\<id\\>.json?include=memberships (#44468). Fixed in 7.0.2,\n>   6.1.5 and 6.0.12.\n> - High: Private/invisible issue subjects leaked via REST API\n>   include=children (#44467). Fixed in 7.0.2, 6.1.5 and 6.0.12.\n> - Moderate: Reflected XSS in attachments#edit_all (unvalidated\n>   back_url) (#44682). Fixed in 7.0.3, 6.1.6 and 6.0.12.\n> - Moderate: OAuth token scopes are bypassed when creating projects\n>   (#44644). Affects 6.1.0 and later; fixed in 7.0.3 and 6.1.6.\n> - Low: validate_back_url accepts URLs that browsers resolve to another\n>   host (#44683). Fixed in 7.0.3, 6.1.6 and 6.0.12.\n",
    "id": "FreeBSD-2026-0590",
